Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:43.75,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“The value is in
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:43.75,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}remediation, not detection”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,it's also true that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.86,0:00:02.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,there's more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:03.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,vulnerabilities than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:04.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,ever before like they're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:05.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,kind of exponentially
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:09.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,growing and so While all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:09.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,contributions are going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:11.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be AI-generated
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:12.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,all, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:13.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,reviews are going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:14.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,AI-generated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:16.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,And I think where the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,value accrues is really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:18.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,just around remediation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:20.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,So it's not really any
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:21.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,more around detection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:22.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's cheaper than ever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:23.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,to have, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:24.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Claude Code as a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:26.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,security reviewer or to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:26.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,use, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:27.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,an open model as a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:28.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,security reviewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:28.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,But I think it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:29.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,inevitable that there's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:30.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,always going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,vulnerabilities that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.57,0:00:32.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,whether they're low
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.39,0:00:32.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,severity or high
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:33.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,severity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.21,0:00:35.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,get merged in at some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.07,0:00:36.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,point and deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.61,0:00:37.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,And so for every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.63,0:00:38.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,enterprise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:39.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think it's a lot more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.03,0:00:40.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,about investing in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:41.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,infrastructure to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.75,0:00:43.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,remediate a lot faster.
